      "score": 29,
      "comments": 5,
      "author": "confusedalex",
      "published": "2026-10-19T08:27:55Z",
      "bullets": [
        "Implements system-level Android VpnService using Arti (Rust), routing device traffic through onion circuits via a local TUN-to-SOCKS translation layer.",
        "Addresses Tor's TCP-only limitation at the virtual interface layer by actively mitigating or dropping UDP traffic to prevent IP leaks.",
        "Utilizes per-app split tunneling to isolate deanonymizing mobile OS telemetry from sensitive application traffic over independent Tor circuits."
      ]
    },
